Harbormaster's HomeKit and UniFi Protect code is written from scratch and
contains no code from the projects below. Their authors worked out, in the
open, how these protocols behave, and Harbormaster could not have been
written without that work:

  unifi-protect and homebridge-unifi-protect, by HJD
  https://github.com/hjdhjd/unifi-protect
  ISC license. The reference for UniFi Protect's private API: sign-in, the
  realtime update stream, the native livestream and talkback.

  HAP-NodeJS, by the Homebridge project and its contributors
  https://github.com/homebridge/HAP-NodeJS
  Apache License 2.0. The reference for the HomeKit Accessory Protocol:
  pairing, camera streaming and HomeKit Secure Video.

